{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43501","headline":"观劒南献捷 · 无名氏","name":"观劒南献捷","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"遐圻新破虏，名将旧登坛。\n戎馘西南至，毡裘长幼观。\n边疆氛已息，矛戟血犹残。\n紫陌欢声动，丹墀喜气盘。\n唐虞方德易，卫霍比功难。\n共覩俘囚入，赓歌万国安。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"无名氏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43501.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43501","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}